    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i> <i>You are inside\u00a0dark maze, can you to get out of here ?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/34584360dce58f29c8ac2a9984236068.poster.avif?t=1751043918\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/34584360dce58f29c8ac2a9984236068.webm?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/34584360dce58f29c8ac2a9984236068.mp4?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lets find out how well you can navigate in complete darkness</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/d00e3a69dba329ed5c3a6d8404c2b762.poster.avif?t=1751043918\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/d00e3a69dba329ed5c3a6d8404c2b762.webm?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/d00e3a69dba329ed5c3a6d8404c2b762.mp4?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong><i>\u00a0the landscape of the area, <strong>search</strong> for unique things in this place that can help you find your way out of here and <strong>don't die</strong>...</i>\u00a0<i>because this is an adventure into the unknown<strong>\u00a0</strong>and who knows what lies up ahead</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/38de23996f6101cef0c292f431b2c61a.poster.avif?t=1751043918\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/38de23996f6101cef0c292f431b2c61a.webm?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618140/extras/38de23996f6101cef0c292f431b2c61a.mp4?t=1751043918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You have 1 attempt to complete the entire path, in case of failure or quitting the game, you will start from the beginning.</i></strong></p>",
